# Phase 1's JavaScript item, first step: the engine the project chose
# (QuickJS-ng 0.15.1 as MacSurf ships it, ES2023; README §5) linked into
# the Vita build and exercised on its own, before any DOM binding.
# - jsprobe.c/.h (new): ES2023 language checks, promise jobs, Unicode
